## Local dev: leave as-is, Vite's dev server proxies /api to localhost:5000 (see vite.config.js).
## Vercel/production: leave as-is too. frontend/vercel.json rewrites /api/* to the
## backend's Vercel domain server-side, so the browser always talks to the frontend's
## own domain — this keeps the admin auth cookie same-origin (no cross-site cookie
## issues between separate *.vercel.app subdomains). If the backend's deployed URL
## ever changes, update the destination in frontend/vercel.json instead of this file.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
